  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 埋\ntitle: bury; embed\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-8, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 10\nradical: 土\nradicalNumber: 32\nonyomi: [マイ]\nkunyomi: [う.める, う.まる, う.もれる, うず.める, うず.まる, い.ける]\ndistractors: [理, 重, 黒]\n---\n\n# 埋 — bury; embed\n\n**Strokes:** 10 · **Key (radical):** 土 (no. 32) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n埋 connects burying or covering something with filling a space. 埋める うめる can mean burying something or filling a gap; 埋葬 まいそう names burial.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Picture 土 heaped around the dense 里-shaped part until it is buried.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| マイ | on | 埋葬 まいそう - burial; interment |\n| う.める | kun | [埋める](../words/埋める.md) うめる - bury; fill a gap |\n| う.まる | kun | 埋まる うまる - be buried; be filled |\n| う.もれる | kun | 埋もれる うもれる - be buried; be hidden |\n| うず.める | kun | 埋める うずめる - bury; cover; bury one's face |\n| うず.まる | kun | 埋まる うずまる - be buried; be covered |\n| い.ける | kun | 埋ける いける - bury; bank a fire with ashes |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [埋める](../words/埋める.md) うめる - bury; fill a gap\n- 埋葬 まいそう - burial; interment\n\n## Notes\n\n- 埋める has separate dictionary entries for うめる and うずめる. The linked word article teaches うめる; the unlinked うずめる row is not permission to change that article's reading.\n- 埋まる うまる is intransitive: something is or becomes buried or filled. 埋もれる うもれる is also intransitive. The two 埋める entries are transitive: someone buries or covers something.\n- JMdict restricts the vacancy-filling and debt-settling senses of 埋まる to うまる. The うずまる example above uses its unrestricted buried or covered senses, not those restricted senses.\n- In the 埋ける example, bank a fire means cover it with ashes to preserve the embers, not put money in a bank.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1524490, 1524500, 1524540, 1524550, 1584340, 2035430.\n",
